= Magnus Hirschfeld

Magnus Hirschfeld is the founder of the Institut für Sexualwissenschaft and an advocate for the rights of sexual minorities.


- @homosexual_rights_
- @womens_rights_
- @science_funding
- @root: Return to main


@homosexual_rights_
title: Homosexual rights
subtitle: Enact policy that supports homosexual rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and progressive_coalition >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?][? if progressive_coalition < 50 : We do not have the votes to enact these policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; homosexual_rights_timer -= 11; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: homosexual_rights


@womens_rights_
title: Women's rights
subtitle: Enact policy with regards to women's rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; womens_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: womens_rights

@science_funding
title: Science funding
subtitle: Increase funding for scientific research.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and economic_minister_party = "SPD" and chancellor_party = "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?][? if economic_minister_party != "SPD": This requires the Economic Ministry. ?][? if chancellor_party != "SPD": The Chancellor must be an SPD member. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1

Socialism has always stood for science and rationality. Despite the setbacks of the Great War, hyperinflation, and the politicized and reactionary attitudes of many academics, science in the German Republic is still the envy of the world. With a great expansion of funding, we hope to keep it that way, and expand on our achievements. 

- @hirschfeld_kwg
- @hirschfeld_applied
- @hirschfeld_medical
- @cancel_advisor_action

@hirschfeld_kwg
title: Fund the Kaiser Wilhelm Society for basic scientific research.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; science += 1; kwg_research += 1; economic_growth += 0.3 if economic_growth <= 8; new_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); ddp_relation += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 0.2 if unemployed >= 4; west_relation += 1; science_funding += 1

The Kaiser Wilhelm Society is one of the most respected scientific research institutions in the world, with physicist Albert Einstein as its most famous employee. Our research program is to provide the Society with additional resources to hire and train scientists and conduct fundamental research, based on the scientists' own interests.

@hirschfeld_applied
title: Fund applied research in economically useful technologies.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; science += 1; applied_research += 1; economic_growth += 0.5 if economic_growth <= 8 and applied_research <= 1; economic_growth += 3 if applied_research > 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); ddp_relation += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 0.5 if unemployed >= 4; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 1; science_funding += 1

Our research program focuses on collaborating with industry to develop useful technologies, creating new research institutions for applied science. This collaboration is focused on economic growth and development.


@hirschfeld_medical
title: Fund biomedical research at the hospitals and medical schools.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; science += 1; medical_research += 1; economic_growth += 0.4 if economic_growth <= 8; new_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); ddp_relation += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 0.2 if unemployed >= 4; science_funding += 1

Our research program focuses on medical research to improve the treatment of diseases and public health. [? if change_sex: Some of our medical advancements include new methods for sex change surgery and hormone therapy for transsexual individuals. ?]
